@base = http://localhost:8080

### List response DTOs
GET {{base}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### Read one book
GET {{base}}/api/books/1

### Missing resource becomes RFC 9457 problem detail
GET {{base}}/api/books/999

### Create a book; inspect 201, Location and the response DTO
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "REST API Demonstration",
  "author": "Didar Akhmet",
  "year": 2026,
  "genre": "PROGRAMMING"
}

> {% client.global.set("bookId", response.body.id); %}

### Follow the identifier from the creation response
GET {{base}}/api/books/{{bookId}}

### Repeat create to demonstrate 409
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"REST API Demonstration","author":"Didar Akhmet","year":2026,"genre":"PROGRAMMING"}

### Empty title becomes 400 with errors[].field
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"","author":"Didar Akhmet","year":2026,"genre":"PROGRAMMING"}

### Replace all editable fields; id and createdAt stay unchanged
PUT {{base}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"REST API Demonstration Revised","author":"Didar Akhmet","year":2025,"genre":"SCIENCE"}

### Variant 1 first page and its metadata
GET {{base}}/api/books?page=0&size=2

### Variant 1 next page
GET {{base}}/api/books?page=1&size=2

### Filter before paging
GET {{base}}/api/books?author=Bloch&page=0&size=1

### Invalid size becomes 400
GET {{base}}/api/books?page=0&size=0

### Delete once: 204 with no body
DELETE {{base}}/api/books/{{bookId}}

### Delete again: 404 problem detail
DELETE {{base}}/api/books/{{bookId}}

### The Lab 6 page keeps its HTML error view
GET {{base}}/books/999
Accept: text/html

### Generated OpenAPI specification
GET {{base}}/v3/api-docs
